msgstr "«%s» aplicada."

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:92
msgid "The active layer has no filter or adjustments to save."
msgstr "La capa activa no tiene filtro ni ajustes que guardar."

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:100
#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:169
msgid "Save Look"
msgstr "Guardar look"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:101
msgid "Name for this look"
msgstr "Nombre de este look"

#. translators: %d: number of actions.
#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:127
#, js-format
msgid "%d action(s) imported."
msgstr "%d acción(es) importada(s)."

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:140
msgid "Recorder"
msgstr "Grabadora"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:148
msgid "Record"
msgstr "Grabar"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:156
msgid "Stop & Save"
msgstr "Detener y guardar"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:163
msgid "Save the active layer’s filter + adjustments as a reusable look"
msgstr "Guardar el filtro y los ajustes de la capa activa como un look reutilizable"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:184
msgid "Recording… apply filters, effects, adjustments, resize/rotate/flip/flatten."
msgstr "Grabando… aplica filtros, efectos, ajustes, redimensionar/girar/voltear/aplanar."

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:192
msgid "Saved Actions"
msgstr "Acciones guardadas"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:281
msgid "My Actions"
msgstr "Mis acciones"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:290
msgid "No own actions yet. Record one or save a look; the bundled set below works right away."
msgstr "Aún no tienes acciones propias. Graba una o guarda un look; el conjunto incluido de abajo funciona desde ya."

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:333
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importar"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:338
msgid "Batch"
msgstr "Lote"

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:346
msgid "Apply an action to many library images at once."
msgstr "Aplica una acción a muchas imágenes de la biblioteca a la vez."

#: src/screens/panels/actions-panel.jsx:356
msgid "Batch Process…"
msgstr "Procesar por lotes…"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:109
#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:276
msgid "Gradient fill"
msgstr "Relleno degradado"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:128
msgid "Adjustment"
msgstr "Ajuste"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:143
#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:239
msgid "Create Adjustment Layer"
msgstr "Crear capa de ajuste"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:152
msgid "Quick fixes"
msgstr "Ajustes rápidos"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:191
msgid "Fine tune"
msgstr "Ajuste fino"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:213
msgid "Adjust:"
msgstr "Ajustar:"

#: src/screens/panels/adjust-panel.jsx:251
#: src/screens/panels/effects-panel.jsx:203
msgid "Reset adjustments"
msgstr "Restablecer ajustes"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:225
msgid "An illustrative image that captures the key points of the article."
msgstr "Una imagen ilustrativa que capta los puntos clave del artículo."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:267
msgid "Select the area first, use the Smart Select tool (K) or “Select Subject” below, then click this again."
msgstr "Selecciona el área primero, con la herramienta Smart Select (K) o «Seleccionar sujeto» abajo, y vuelve a hacer clic aquí."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:276
msgid "Type what you want in the prompt box above first."
msgstr "Escribe primero lo que quieres en el campo de prompt de arriba."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:285
#: src/screens/panorama-dialog.jsx:397
msgid "No AI provider configured."
msgstr "Ningún proveedor de IA configurado."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:314
msgid "Cancelled. The result arrived afterwards and was discarded."
msgstr "Cancelado. El resultado llegó después y se descartó."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:323
msgid "The AI action failed."
msgstr "La acción de IA falló."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:343
msgid "Detects the main subject of the active image and turns it into a selection."
msgstr "Detecta el sujeto principal de la imagen activa y lo convierte en selección."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:354
msgid "Erases the selected area and fills it from the surrounding pixels. ① Select the object (Smart Select “K” / Select Subject). ② Click this. (For tricky fills, the AI-cloud version is stronger.)"
msgstr "Borra la zona seleccionada y la rellena con los píxeles circundantes. ① Selecciona el objeto (Selección inteligente «K» / Seleccionar sujeto). ② Haz clic aquí. (Para rellenos difíciles, la versión de IA en la nube es más potente.)"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:364
msgid "Sends the active layer to the AI and recreates it at much higher quality, sharper, cleaner and more detailed, keeping the same subject, colors and composition."
msgstr "Envía la capa activa a la IA y la recrea con mucha más calidad, más nítida, limpia y detallada, manteniendo el mismo sujeto, colores y composición."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:374
msgid "Flattens the whole canvas as a reference and redesigns it to a professional standard, keeping the layout, text and composition but making it noticeably cooler and more polished. Adds the result as a new layer on top."
msgstr "Acopla todo el lienzo como referencia y lo rediseña a un nivel profesional, manteniendo la composición, el texto y la estructura pero haciéndolo notablemente más atractivo y pulido. Añade el resultado como capa nueva encima."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:381
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1342
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1351
msgid "Design Review"
msgstr "Design Review"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:383
msgid "An art director looks at your design and answers in your editor language: one overall verdict plus the few changes with the biggest impact."
msgstr "Un director de arte mira tu diseño y responde en el idioma de tu editor: un veredicto general más los pocos cambios de mayor impacto."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:390
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1476
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1485
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1540
msgid "Improve Text"
msgstr "Improve Text"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:393
msgid "Five stronger alternatives for the selected text layer, same language and length - pick one and it replaces the text."
msgstr "Cinco alternativas más fuertes para la capa de texto seleccionada, mismo idioma y longitud: elige una y reemplaza el texto."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:403
msgid "Erases the selected area, the AI reconstructs what was behind it. ① Select the object (Smart Select tool “K”, or “Select Subject” below). ② Click this."
msgstr "Borra el área seleccionada y la IA reconstruye lo que había detrás. ① Selecciona el objeto (herramienta Smart Select «K» o «Seleccionar sujeto» abajo). ② Haz clic aquí."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:410
msgid "Remove BG"
msgstr "Quitar fondo"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:413
msgid "Cuts out the subject of the active image layer, the background becomes transparent."
msgstr "Recorta el sujeto de la capa de imagen activa; el fondo se vuelve transparente."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:425
msgid "Blur radius (px)"
msgstr "Radio de desenfoque (px)"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:433
msgid "Keeps the subject sharp and blurs everything behind it (portrait effect), asks for the blur strength."
msgstr "Mantiene el sujeto nítido y desenfoca todo lo de detrás (efecto retrato); pregunta por la intensidad."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:443
msgid "Graduated background blur with a focus/strength slider, from a depth map (depth-of-field)."
msgstr "Desenfoque de fondo graduado con controles de foco/intensidad, a partir de un mapa de profundidad (profundidad de campo)."

#. translators: %d: face count.
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:457
#, js-format
msgid "Made %d face(s) unrecognizable."
msgstr "%d cara(s) hechas irreconocibles."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:462
msgid "Finds every face on the active layer and pixelates it beyond recognition, e.g. for privacy-safe photos. Runs locally, nothing leaves your browser."
msgstr "Encuentra todas las caras de la capa activa y las pixela hasta hacerlas irreconocibles, p. ej. para fotos respetuosas con la privacidad. Funciona localmente; nada sale de tu navegador."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:490
msgid "Traces the active image into editable vector shapes (SVG paths)."
msgstr "Convierte la imagen activa en formas vectoriales editables (trazados SVG)."

#. translators: 1: width, 2: height.
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:506
#, js-format
msgid "Source resolution is now %1$d × %2$d px. The layer keeps its size on canvas; zooms and exports get sharper."
msgstr "La resolución de origen es ahora %1$d × %2$d px. La capa mantiene su tamaño en el lienzo; el zoom y las exportaciones ganan nitidez."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:515
msgid "Doubles the source resolution of the active image layer; the layer keeps its size on canvas."
msgstr "Duplica la resolución de origen de la capa de imagen activa; la capa mantiene su tamaño en el lienzo."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:522
msgid "Inpaint"
msgstr "Inpainting"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:527
msgid "Repaints ONLY the selected area from your prompt, everything else stays. ① Select an area. ② Type what should go there (prompt box above). ③ Click this."
msgstr "Repinta SOLO el área seleccionada según tu prompt, todo lo demás se mantiene. ① Selecciona un área. ② Escribe qué debe aparecer (campo de prompt arriba). ③ Haz clic aquí."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:534
msgid "Outpaint"
msgstr "Outpainting"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:542
msgid "Extends the picture outward, the AI invents more scenery. Fills empty canvas around your image, or enlarges the canvas by 25% per side if it’s already full. An optional prompt steers what appears."
msgstr "Amplía la imagen hacia fuera: la IA inventa más escenario. Rellena el lienzo vacío alrededor de tu imagen o agranda el lienzo un 25% por lado si ya está lleno. Un prompt opcional dirige lo que aparece."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:552
msgid "One-click auto color, contrast and sharpness boost for the active image layer."
msgstr "Mejora automática de color, contraste y nitidez de la capa de imagen activa con un clic."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:561
msgid "Adds natural, realistic color to a black-and-white photo on the active image layer."
msgstr "Añade color natural y realista a una foto en blanco y negro en la capa de imagen activa."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:570
msgid "Redraws the active image layer as a clean, vibrant cartoon illustration."
msgstr "Redibuja la capa de imagen activa como una ilustración de dibujos animados limpia y vibrante."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:579
msgid "Repairs an old or damaged photo on the active layer, removes scratches, dust and noise and improves clarity."
msgstr "Repara una foto antigua o dañada en la capa activa: quita arañazos, polvo y ruido y mejora la claridad."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:586
msgid "Replace BG"
msgstr "Reemplazar fondo"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:593
msgid "Keeps the subject (cut out locally) and generates a NEW background from your prompt behind it. Type the background you want in the prompt box first."
msgstr "Mantiene el sujeto (recortado localmente) y genera un NUEVO fondo detrás según tu prompt. Escribe primero el fondo que quieres en el campo de prompt."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:603
msgid "Smooths and slightly tightens the cutout edge of the active image layer, cleans Remove-BG fringes."
msgstr "Suaviza y ciñe ligeramente el borde de recorte de la capa de imagen activa; limpia los halos del quitar fondo."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:613
msgid "Crops the canvas to the detected subject with a small margin."
msgstr "Recorta el lienzo al sujeto detectado con un pequeño margen."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:623
msgid "Cuts out the subject and adds a white sticker outline with a soft shadow."
msgstr "Recorta el sujeto y añade un contorno de pegatina blanco con sombra suave."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:633
msgid "Cuts out the subject locally and slides an editable headline between background and subject - the magazine cover look."
msgstr "Recorta el sujeto localmente y desliza un titular editable entre el fondo y el sujeto - el look de portada de revista."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:643
msgid "Keeps the subject in color and turns everything else black and white - fully local, soft edges included."
msgstr "Mantiene el sujeto en color y convierte todo lo demás a blanco y negro - totalmente local, con bordes suaves."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:653
msgid "Cuts out the subject and centers it on clean white with a soft contact shadow - the catalog look."
msgstr "Recorta el sujeto y lo centra sobre blanco puro con una suave sombra de contacto - el look de catálogo."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:663
msgid "Dims the background and wraps the subject in a glowing rim - uses your first vivid Brand Kit color when one is set."
msgstr "Oscurece el fondo y envuelve el sujeto en un borde luminoso - usa el primer color vivo de tu Brand Kit si hay uno configurado."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:673
msgid "Zoom-blurs the background around the sharp subject - instant motion."
msgstr "Aplica un desenfoque de zoom al fondo alrededor del sujeto nítido - movimiento instantáneo."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:683
msgid "Adds atmospheric haze staged by real depth - clear up front, misty in the distance."
msgstr "Añade bruma atmosférica escalonada según la profundidad real - nítido delante, brumoso a lo lejos."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:690
msgid "Variations"
msgstr "Variantes"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:693
msgid "Generates 4 alternative takes on the active layer to choose from (OpenAI)."
msgstr "Genera 4 variantes de la capa activa para elegir (OpenAI)."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:703
msgid "Generating image…"
msgstr "Generando imagen…"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:704
msgid "Editing layer…"
msgstr "Editando capa…"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:705
msgid "Rendering your sketch…"
msgstr "Convirtiendo tu boceto…"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:711
msgid "Working…"
msgstr "Trabajando…"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:740
msgid "Describe what to generate or change… e.g., “add soft morning light”, “make the background minimal and cream colored”"
msgstr "Describe qué generar o cambiar… p. ej. «añade luz suave de mañana», «haz el fondo minimalista y de color crema»"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:774
msgid "No provider, local tools only"
msgstr "Sin proveedor, solo herramientas locales"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:800
msgid "Match the document’s aspect ratio"
msgstr "Usar la proporción del documento"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:804
msgid "Generation aspect ratio"
msgstr "Proporción de la generación"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:821
msgid "The image model draws flat artwork and the local tracer turns it into editable path layers - a prompt becomes real shapes, not pixels."
msgstr "El modelo de imagen dibuja arte plano y el trazador local lo convierte en capas de trazados editables: un prompt se convierte en formas reales, no píxeles."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:835
msgid "Turn into editable vector"
msgstr "Convertir en vector editable"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:842
msgid "PNG is lossless; JPEG is a fraction of the size and fine for photographic results."
msgstr "PNG no tiene pérdidas; JPEG ocupa una fracción y va bien para resultados fotográficos."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:861
msgid "The model leaves the background out - a real alpha channel, not a checkerboard."
msgstr "El modelo deja el fondo fuera, con un canal alfa real y no un cuadriculado."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:865
msgid "Only the OpenAI image models can return real transparency."
msgstr "Solo los modelos de imagen de OpenAI pueden devolver transparencia real."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:882
#: src/screens/qr-dialog.jsx:1059
msgid "Transparent background"
msgstr "Fondo transparente"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:902
msgid "Panorama inserted - open Tools → 360° Panorama to walk through it and copy the embed."
msgstr "Panorama insertado: abre Herramientas → Panorama 360° para recorrerlo y copiar la inserción."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:919
msgid "Generate Vector"
msgstr "Generar vector"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:974
msgid "Edit Layer"
msgstr "Editar capa"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:980
msgid "Turn the whole canvas (a rough multi-layer sketch) into a finished image, using the flattened sketch as reference."
msgstr "Convierte todo el lienzo (un boceto tosco de varias capas) en una imagen terminada, usando el boceto aplanado como referencia."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1005
msgid "From Document"
msgstr "Desde el documento"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1011
msgid "Pick a post; its title, excerpt and content ride along with your prompt, e.g. for a quick article infographic."
msgstr "Elige una entrada; su título, extracto y contenido acompañan a tu prompt, p. ej. para una infografía rápida del artículo."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1026
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1561
msgid "From Post"
msgstr "Desde entrada"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1033
msgid "Colors, fonts and logo of the selected Brand Kit ride along; the logo is attached as a reference image."
msgstr "Los colores, fuentes y logotipo del kit de marca elegido acompañan la petición; el logotipo se adjunta como imagen de referencia."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1046
msgid "Include brand details"
msgstr "Incluir detalles de marca"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1061
msgid "(unnamed kit)"
msgstr "(kit sin nombre)"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1130
msgid "Local tools"
msgstr "Herramientas locales"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1140
msgid "These run entirely in your browser, no key needed, and your image never leaves your site."
msgstr "Esto funciona por completo en tu navegador, sin clave, y tu imagen nunca sale de tu sitio."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1171
msgid "AI cloud"
msgstr "IA en la nube"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1182
msgid "These run on your configured AI provider and may incur cost."
msgstr "Se ejecutan con tu proveedor de IA configurado y pueden generar costes."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1186
msgid "These need an AI provider key (may cost)."
msgstr "Necesitan una clave de proveedor de IA (puede tener coste)."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1197
msgid "add one in Settings"
msgstr "añádela en Ajustes"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1233
msgid "This can take a few seconds."
msgstr "Puede tardar unos segundos."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1270
#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1279
msgid "Choose a variation"
msgstr "Elige una variante"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1286
msgid "Pick the variation to keep; the rest are discarded."
msgstr "Elige la variante que quieres conservar; el resto se descarta."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1313
msgid "AI Variation"
msgstr "Variante con IA"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1356
msgid "One overall verdict plus the changes with the biggest impact - in your editor language."
msgstr "Un veredicto general más los cambios de mayor impacto, en el idioma de tu editor."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1490
msgid "Pick an alternative - it replaces the text on the layer, undo brings the old one back."
msgstr "Elige una alternativa: reemplaza el texto de la capa, deshacer recupera el anterior."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1520
msgid "Original:"
msgstr "Original:"

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1544
msgid "Text replaced - undo restores the original."
msgstr "Texto reemplazado: deshacer restaura el original."

#: src/screens/panels/ai-panel.jsx:1562
msgid "The picked post’s content rides along with your prompt."
msgstr "El contenido de la entrada elegida acompaña a tu prompt."

#: src/screens/panels/brush-panel.jsx:62
msgctxt "brush tip"
msgid "Scatter"
msgstr "Dispersión"

#: src/screens/panels/brush-panel.jsx:64
msgid "Opacity jitter"
msgstr "Variación de opacidad"

#: src/screens/panels/brush-panel.jsx:65
